<body>
    <h1>Disable Polarion ALM Accounts</h1>
    <div class=3D"Section1">
        <p><strong><strong><u>Scenario 1:&nbsp;</u></strong></strong><u><st=
rong style=3D"letter-spacing: 0.0px;">Disable user account in Polarion:</st=
rong></u></p>
<p>When a user is no longer a part of the Organization, the Project Admins =
raises a request via QService to remove the users from Polarion and to disa=
ble their accounts.</p>
<p>Test</p>
<p>AMS Engineer can disable the user account by following below steps:</p>
<p><span style=3D"letter-spacing: 0.0px;">&nbsp;1. Login to Polarion as Adm=
inistrator.</span></p>
<p><span style=3D"letter-spacing: 0.0px;">&nbsp;2. Click on User Management=
&nbsp;=E2=86=92 Users</span></p>
<p><span style=3D"letter-spacing: 0.0px;">&nbsp;3. Search the user using th=
e Search box.</span></p>
<p><span class=3D"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper confluence-embedded-manu=
al-size"><img class=3D"confluence-embedded-image confluence-content-image-b=
order" draggable=3D"false" height=3D"244" width=3D"468" src=3D"8504c110e93c=
0be7a14470acef6149ddc557fdba613d71e3c8deb8ab47ad91ba" data-image-src=3D"/do=
wnload/attachments/82203079/image2021-10-19_17-21-33.png?version=3D1&amp;mo=
dificationDate=3D1634644295381&amp;api=3Dv2" data-unresolved-comment-count=
=3D"0" data-linked-resource-id=3D"82203294" data-linked-resource-version=3D=
"1" data-linked-resource-type=3D"attachment" data-linked-resource-default-a=
lias=3D"image2021-10-19_17-21-33.png" data-base-url=3D"https://bluespace.fm=
eone.com" data-linked-resource-content-type=3D"image/png" data-linked-resou=
rce-container-id=3D"82203079" data-linked-resource-container-version=3D"13"=
 tabindex=3D"0" alt=3D""></span></p>
<p><span style=3D"letter-spacing: 0.0px;">&nbsp;4.</span><span style=3D"let=
ter-spacing: 0.0px;">Click on Edit</span></p>
<p><span style=3D"letter-spacing: 0.0px;">&nbsp;5. Take the screenshots of =
the projects that the user had access and paste them in the ticket.</span><=
/p>
<p>&nbsp;6. Remove the user from all Roles in all the Projects and also Glo=
bal Roles.</p>
<p><span class=3D"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper confluence-embedded-manu=
al-size"><img class=3D"confluence-embedded-image confluence-content-image-b=
order" draggable=3D"false" height=3D"223" width=3D"468" src=3D"4b1b3236b2a3=
3ff783a61f43b5a77c3a5d7b62b165fcf6e7ba4013c7316cf4ab" data-image-src=3D"/do=
wnload/attachments/82203079/image2021-10-19_17-22-50.png?version=3D1&amp;mo=
dificationDate=3D1634644371140&amp;api=3Dv2" data-unresolved-comment-count=
=3D"0" data-linked-resource-id=3D"82203318" data-linked-resource-version=3D=
"1" data-linked-resource-type=3D"attachment" data-linked-resource-default-a=
lias=3D"image2021-10-19_17-22-50.png" data-base-url=3D"https://bluespace.fm=
eone.com" data-linked-resource-content-type=3D"image/png" data-linked-resou=
rce-container-id=3D"82203079" data-linked-resource-container-version=3D"13"=
 tabindex=3D"0" alt=3D""></span></p>
<p><span style=3D"letter-spacing: 0.0px;">7. Click on Disable Notifications=
</span></p>
<p><span class=3D"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper confluence-embedded-manu=
al-size"><img class=3D"confluence-embedded-image confluence-content-image-b=
order" draggable=3D"false" height=3D"226" width=3D"468" src=3D"a046579799e7=
fa4ab88a11168452da89d31c03d432c6f911fccd74f0cae03ed6" data-image-src=3D"/do=
wnload/attachments/82203079/image2021-10-19_17-24-2.png?version=3D1&amp;mod=
ificationDate=3D1634644443328&amp;api=3Dv2" data-unresolved-comment-count=
=3D"0" data-linked-resource-id=3D"82203342" data-linked-resource-version=3D=
"1" data-linked-resource-type=3D"attachment" data-linked-resource-default-a=
lias=3D"image2021-10-19_17-24-2.png" data-base-url=3D"https://bluespace.fme=
one.com" data-linked-resource-content-type=3D"image/png" data-linked-resour=
ce-container-id=3D"82203079" data-linked-resource-container-version=3D"13" =
tabindex=3D"0" alt=3D""></span></p>
<p>8.&nbsp; <span style=3D"letter-spacing: 0.0px;">Add (C_old) in the end o=
f user's name and email id needs to be removed.</span></p>
<p>In the description section, mention as below.</p>
<p>Ex:</p>
<p>User is disabled on 06-02-2023 as a part of PALM-xxxx<br>
  Email is removed - &lt;email address&gt;</p>
<p><span class=3D"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper confluence-embedded-manu=
al-size"><img class=3D"confluence-embedded-image confluence-content-image-b=
order" draggable=3D"false" height=3D"250" width=3D"392" src=3D"82dce6b51cae=
0319c953634ea5ab38a542657cf7ef0da2b21b832a06052f0362" data-image-src=3D"/do=
wnload/attachments/82203079/image2021-10-19_17-26-37.png?version=3D1&amp;mo=
dificationDate=3D1634644597958&amp;api=3Dv2" data-unresolved-comment-count=
=3D"0" data-linked-resource-id=3D"82203343" data-linked-resource-version=3D=
"1" data-linked-resource-type=3D"attachment" data-linked-resource-default-a=
lias=3D"image2021-10-19_17-26-37.png" data-base-url=3D"https://bluespace.fm=
eone.com" data-linked-resource-content-type=3D"image/png" data-linked-resou=
rce-container-id=3D"82203079" data-linked-resource-container-version=3D"13"=
 tabindex=3D"0" alt=3D""></span></p>
<p>9. Click on Save.</p>
<p>10. Follow the same steps in Mirror and Mirror 2 server to disabled the =
user accounts.</p>
<p>11. Update the QService ticket and close it.</p>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
